{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23329","headline":"题灵岩寺 · 白居易","name":"题灵岩寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"娃宫屧廊寻已倾，砚池香径又欲平。\n二三月时何草绿，几百年来空月明。\n使君虽老颇多思，携觞领妓处处行。\n今愁古恨入丝竹，一曲凉州无限情。\n直自当时到今日，中间歌吹更无声。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23329.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23329","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}